 and it is why a consumer\ndocs/design/dao.stream.md:784:  kept cursors cover repositioning.\ndocs/design/dao.stream.md:912:TBD\", while *Explicitly Absent* removes `seek`: a kept cursor is therefore the\ndocs/design/dao.stream.md:918:invalidating every kept cursor; a durable consumer resuming after restart;\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
