 2. Governing invariants\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:136:**I1. Code at rest is content in `dao.jing`.** An image, a row, a vector,\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:142:**I2. Code in motion is a stream in `dao.stream`.** A request for code, a\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:150:**I3. Location is not identity.** Whether the content is in this process,\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:156:**I4. No operation waits.** The portable linker interface is a step that\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:161:**I5. Verification is address-directed and identity-directed, and both\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:170:**I6. The VM never invokes a loader.** Absence of code is a park plus a\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:175:**I7. The registry is a value.** `yin.vm.module` already keeps the\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:181:**I8. Fail closed.** Every ambiguity the linker can detect (two manifests\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:186:## 3. Identities: three kinds, one address space\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:191:| Kind             | Example                              | Owner            |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:193:| storage address  | `:segment/blake3-...`                | `dao.jing`       |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:194:| format identity  | H, R, a vector address, a root row id| the format       |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:195:| module name      | `'my.lib`                            | name environment |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:197:**Storage address.** `(jing/segment-key payload)` under the storage\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:201:**Format identity.** What the VM contract calls the code. There are two\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:224:**Module name.** A symbol resolved through a name environment to a\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:246:## 4. The fetch pipeline\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:248:### 4.1 The format record\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:320:### 4.2 The six steps\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:526:### 4.3 Refusal vocabulary\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:531:| Reason                  | Step   | Meaning                                  |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:533:| `:invalid-request`      | 0      | a request outside the closed key set of  |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:534:|                         |        | section 6.3, or with a non-portable value|\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:535:| `:absent`               | 1 or 2 | no index entry, or no payload at the     |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:536:|                         |        | address (root or any part)               |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:537:| `:address-mismatch`     | 2      | payload does not hash to its address     |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:538:| `:parts-limit`          | 2      | a composition bound on parts, depth, or  |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:539:|                         |        | bytes was exceeded                       |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:540:| `:hash-mismatch`        | 3      | root value does not match the identity   |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:541:| `:descriptor-defect`    | 2 or 4 | row-local or whole-value validation      |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:542:|                         |        | failed                                   |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:543:| `:contract-mismatch`    | 0      | the request, or the manifest's entry for |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:544:|                         |        | the requested format, names an execution |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:545:|                         |        | contract the format record does not      |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:546:|                         |        | implement                                |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:547:| `:use-before-definition`| 5a     | a main-sequence occurrence precedes      |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:548:|                         |        | every definition of its name             |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:549:| `:undeclared-free`      | 5a     | a free name has no declaration in the    |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:550:|                         |        | manifest that delivered the image        |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:551:| `:unresolved-free`      | 5b     | an obligation is not discharged by an    |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:552:|                         |        | equal profile or manifest                |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:553:| `:shadowed-free`        | 5b     | an obligation's name is bound by the     |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:554:|                         |        | receiver's free env or store             |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:555:| `:unsupported-format`   | 0      | the receiver holds no kernel or format   |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:556:|                         |        | record for the requested format          |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:557:| `:module-name-mismatch` | 8.1    | the manifest declares a name other than  |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:558:|                         |        | the one it was resolved under            |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:559:| `:ambiguous-name`       | 8.2    | more than one accepted assertion for a   |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:560:|                         |        | name at the snapshot                     |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:561:| `:derivation-mismatch`  | 8.1    | an image's derivation record does not    |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:562:|                         |        | lead from the manifest's tree, or a      |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:563:|                         |        | verifying re-lowering disagrees          |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:564:| `:unverified-derivation`| 8.1    | a verifying link cannot recompute the    |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:565:|                         |        | derivation (profile not implemented, or  |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:566:|                         |        | tree unavailable) and refuses to trust   |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:567:| `:unauthenticated`      | 8.2    | an assertion carries no proof the        |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:568:|                         |        | composition's verifier accepts           |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:569:| `:export-missing`       | 7.3    | the evaluated module did not bind an     |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:570:|                         |        | export the manifest names                |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:571:| `:require-cycle`        | 7.4    | a child install requires a module that   |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:572:|                         |        | is itself installing in its ancestry     |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:573:| `:foreign-image`        | 7.3    | an exported closure originates in an     |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:574:|                         |        | image this scheduler never verified      |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:575:| `:binding-mismatch`     | 7.3    | a positional closure marker lowered into |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:576:|                         |        | a named kernel, or the reverse           |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:577:| `:pairing-mismatch`     | verify | B6's same-root check (now a case of      |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:578:|                         |        | `:derivation-mismatch`, kept by name)    |\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:589:## 5. Format records for the four backends\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:595:### 5.1 `:yin.ast/code` (the AST walker)\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:630:### 5.2 `:yin.semantic/code` (the semantic VM)\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:660:### 5.3 `:yin.debruijn.code` (the stack VM)\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:685:### 5.4 `:yin.debruijn.register` (the register VM)\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:707:### 5.5 Same-root pairing becomes derivation verification\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:718:## 6. Linking is a stream exchange\\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.md:720:### 6.1 The topology